  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Style.Width` and `Style.Height` accept `Auto`, `Cells(n)`, `Flex(n)`, or `Percent(n)`.",
    "source": "dimension.go",
    "symbol": "Dimension",
    "evidence": "Dimension declares these constructors; Style dimensions are Dimension fields.",
    "source_sha256": "84ecc296f1737eec5dc3f26082d9c8488b28045324adb69a72bff96dc4146d8a"
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Auto` sizes from content, and `Cells(n)` requests a fixed number of cells.",
    "source": "dimension.go",
    "symbol": "Auto",
    "evidence": "Dimension definitions document and implement these sizing modes.",
    "source_sha256": "84ecc296f1737eec5dc3f26082d9c8488b28045324adb69a72bff96dc4146d8a"
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Flex(n)` assigns a share of the remaining space along a container axis.",
    "source": "layout/linear_node.go",
    "symbol": "LinearNode",
    "evidence": "LinearNode allocates remaining space proportionally to flex factors.",
    "source_sha256": "74c626be6d08fb2d551640169bf347a9722daa07f10b61f24d4673587a1bdcf0"
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Percent(n)` requests a percentage of the parent's available space, before fixed-size siblings consume their share.",
    "source": "dimension.go",
    "symbol": "Percent",
    "evidence": "Percent documents that its percentage uses total available space rather than remaining space after fixed children.",
    "source_sha256": "84ecc296f1737eec5dc3f26082d9c8488b28045324adb69a72bff96dc4146d8a"
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Style.MinWidth`, `Style.MaxWidth`, `Style.MinHeight`, and `Style.MaxHeight` constrain dimensions.",
    "source": "style.go",
    "symbol": "Style",
    "evidence": "These Dimension fields populate DimensionSet constraints.",
    "source_sha256": "589e24c7728cfcb014ed75e1e4b869314a36c1d722bcdb8199cdad312f933395"
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Row.Spacing` and `Column.Spacing` set gaps between children.",
    "source": "layout.go",
    "symbol": "Row.BuildContainerLayoutNode",
    "evidence": "Spacing passed into LinearNode.",
    "source_sha256": "394b8dc145ee5d2332d4b6cc95ecd1b3993b8b90d88c09e9ac71f7f54533fff4"
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Style.Padding` reserves space inside the border.",
    "source": "layout/box_model.go",
    "symbol": "BoxModel",
    "evidence": "Padding shrinks inner content bounds.",
    "source_sha256": "510b8085b1c5220e1dc035116777b4b0604ea08f989f429d05249ab2442dd60b"
  },
  {
    "page": "docs/layout/index.md",
    "text": "`Style.Margin` reserves space outside the border.",
    "source": "layout/linear_node.go",
    "symbol": "LinearNode",
    "evidence": "Child margins are added around child sizes in layout.",
    "source_sha256": "74c626be6d08fb2d551640169bf347a9722daa07f10b61f24d4673587a1bdcf0"
  },
  {
